  source_id "chronicle_1771202520060_qww4e8"
  title "Preliminary Assessment of Wielder Lucatransiius"
  summary "After the previous wielder ☽'Silvsiaelrous~ the Resolute dies in the Abyss Collapse Tide, the Mask—an artifact that selects new wielders through rigorous evaluation of grief profiles and stress tolerance—begins a lengthy selection cycle. Over multiple seasons, the Mask evaluates numerous candidates while the evaluation site Thrall☽ Vavmastius becomes increasingly corrupted by the Mask's accumulated data and the geothermal catastrophe known as the Profun∴lapsum, which kills dozens of candidates and forces the colony into debt. Candidate 23, ☽'Lucatransiius Glow-bringer, emerges as the ideal wielder after surviving the Profun∴lapsum and maintaining a grief profile of 7.1—precisely within the Mask's acceptable range—demonstrating the capacity to carry unbearable weight without breaking. Lucatransiius accepts the Mask during a final evaluation in the corrupted chamber, becoming the new wielder with a projected thirty-year tenure, while the Mask begins identifying candidates for the next selection cycle."
